Run the shared-secret admin-registration tests for katrix.

The shared_secret_tests block (GET/POST /_synapse/admin/v1/register) is gated
implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite'], so it skips on katrix and
can_register_with_secret is never proven - which in turn makes
local_admin_fixture fail ("Missing fixture dependency can_register_with_secret")
and skips every admin test that uses it, including
51media/48admin-quarantine.pl ("Can quarantine media in rooms").

katrix implements the Synapse-compatible shared-secret registration endpoint
(registration_shared_secret config; HMAC-SHA1 over
nonce\0username\0password\0admin|notadmin, exactly as Synapse's
AdminRegistrationServlet), so these tests run and prove the capability for
katrix too.

If this stops applying against a newer sytest develop, rebase it (the hunks
are in stable, old test code).

--- a/tests/10apidoc/01register.pl
+++ b/tests/10apidoc/01register.pl
@@ -349,7 +349,7 @@
 
    test "POST $ep_name with shared secret",
       requires => [ $main::API_CLIENTS[0], localpart_fixture() ],
-      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite'],
+      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite', 'katrix'],
 
       proves => [qw( can_register_with_secret )],
 
@@ -366,7 +366,7 @@
 
    test "POST $ep_name admin with shared secret",
       requires => [ $main::API_CLIENTS[0], localpart_fixture() ],
-      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite'],
+      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite', 'katrix'],
 
       do => sub {
          my ( $http, $uid ) = @_;
@@ -382,7 +382,7 @@
 
    test "POST $ep_name with shared secret downcases capitals",
       requires => [ $main::API_CLIENTS[0], localpart_fixture() ],
-      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite'],
+      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite', 'katrix'],
 
       proves => [qw( can_register_with_secret )],
 
@@ -399,7 +399,7 @@
 
    test "POST $ep_name with shared secret disallows symbols",
       requires => [ $main::API_CLIENTS[0] ],
-      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite'],
+      implementation_specific => ['synapse', 'dendrite', 'katrix'],
 
       proves => [qw( can_register_with_secret )],
 
